abstract: >
  Software for PLIF image acquisition and controller communication used in plume
  experiments at the University of Bristol. Includes the Linux camera receiver,
  SDK build helper, frame-storage request tool and BeagleBone GPIO controller.
  The Teledyne DALSA GigE-V SDK is installed separately.
